      "height": 82.5,
      "text": "Demo target: Convex owns the AP journal; an ERP integration is deferred for this slice.\nFuture ERP option: let its formal books stay authoritative; Convex then owns workflow + evidence.\nValidate the thin sandbox path alongside deterministic fault tests before expanding the architecture.",
